<div style="float:left;line-height:7pt;text-align:left;width:2.88pt;"><font style="color:#333333;font-family:Arial Narrow;font-size:5pt;position:relative;top:0;">1</font></div>
<div style="float:left;line-height:10.0pt;margin-left:7.12pt;text-align:left;width:245.00pt;"><font style="color:#333333;font-family:Arial Narrow;font-size:8pt;">&#8220;Other Expenses&#8221; reflect estimated expenses for the Fund's first fiscal
